== Relation to the broader knowledge graph ==

The halo effect connects to [[Related to::Cognition|cognitive judgment]], [[Related to::Reasoning|inference]], [[Related to::Metacognition|awareness of decisions]] and [[Related to::Decision theory|evaluation]]. No single shared trait-correlation pattern proves any one of these mechanisms.

